{"4456600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deliverage", "steam_appid": 4456600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your own cargo empire in a <strong>dangerous open world</strong> where every delivery counts. <strong>Upgrade vehicles</strong>, outrun bandits, <strong>fight rival players</strong> and dominate a player-driven economy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/cd60d53638caa2bcc3bfafdfe9d1801a.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=340 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/cd60d53638caa2bcc3bfafdfe9d1801a.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/cd60d53638caa2bcc3bfafdfe9d1801a.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Team up with friends to gain <strong>strength in numbers.</strong> Organize car meets, run trade convoys or <strong>dominate key trade routes together</strong>. The <strong>economy is fully player-driven</strong>, every delivery affects supply and demand. <strong>Spot low prices</strong>, move goods quickly, and <strong>beat competitors</strong> before the market shifts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/e88d8a5dcf0769fb0d0300bd3f09eb1a.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/e88d8a5dcf0769fb0d0300bd3f09eb1a.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/e88d8a5dcf0769fb0d0300bd3f09eb1a.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/fa49ca3510c31944810f11ad409b0768.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=340 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/fa49ca3510c31944810f11ad409b0768.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/fa49ca3510c31944810f11ad409b0768.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Purchase various vehicles for your <strong>hard-earned</strong> cash, <strong>upgrade them</strong> to improve cargo capacity, engine power and durability. Deliver more goods per trip, travel faster and endure rougher terrain, but beware: <strong>repairs add up fast</strong>. After a bad crash, a car that looks like a pancake might no longer be worth fixing. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/2b432e948eb231c82ee97fd6f1fd3cba.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/2b432e948eb231c82ee97fd6f1fd3cba.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/2b432e948eb231c82ee97fd6f1fd3cba.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/a39902cabce7afb7669ea4f8a3fd740e.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=340 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/a39902cabce7afb7669ea4f8a3fd740e.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/a39902cabce7afb7669ea4f8a3fd740e.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Explore the open world freely and <strong>carve your own path.</strong> <strong>Discover new vehicles</strong>, <strong>rare resources</strong>, and profitable <strong>trade routes</strong>. If you can afford it, you can buy it - no restrictions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/4014969334e28bb05725cbfe82718508.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/4014969334e28bb05725cbfe82718508.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/4014969334e28bb05725cbfe82718508.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/83f29fcdf628d03fdba1d812655ef076.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=340 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/83f29fcdf628d03fdba1d812655ef076.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/83f29fcdf628d03fdba1d812655ef076.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Manage risk while completing deliveries across a dangerous world. <strong>Cars deform from crashes</strong>, they break down and <strong>run out of fuel.</strong> <strong>You can push, tow, repair and or scrap</strong> your damaged vehicles. If you forget to refuel or smash into every rock on the way, you might <strong>get stranded in the middle</strong> <strong>of nowhere</strong> with a van full of valuable cargo.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/6a905e7d842be08627754d35e7f29341.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/6a905e7d842be08627754d35e7f29341.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/6a905e7d842be08627754d35e7f29341.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/7fc881b24cc61551b98a207d10b4c96e.poster.avif?t=1785788189\" width=340 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/7fc881b24cc61551b98a207d10b4c96e.webm?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456600/extras/7fc881b24cc61551b98a207d10b4c96e.mp4?t=1785788189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>In this world, <strong>whoever delivers the cargo keeps the profits</strong>. Carrying valuable goods makes you a target for NPC bandits and other players alike. <strong>Criminal players build bounties</strong> as they cause chaos, increasing the reward for taking them down. <strong>Buy weapons</strong> and ammunition, <strong>defend your cargo</strong>, and be prepared for <strong>ambushes</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i